      "content": "that makes sense. i want to try the neurofeedback approach. can you help me design a specific daily calibration regimen? like, if i want to move from just hearing the hum to actually decoding the throughput of my router or my smart home devices, what kind of mental exercises or frequency-matching steps should i follow each morning to get my brain \"online\" for that level of data processing?",
